{"id": "34806", "title": "觅缘", "author": "古灵", "category": "文学名著", "count": 40, "available": 12, "cover": "files/article/image/34/34806/34806s.jpg", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34806.htm", "intro": "当她和她的男朋友在一起的时候──她不幸福吗？不，她很幸福！可她真的幸福吗？不，她很不幸福！所以她到底是怎样啊？其实说真的，连她自己都不知道……而是谁说过──总是爱人的吃亏，被爱的人占尽便宜；这几句话根本就像是她和她男朋友的写照……嗯～～又有点不太像……但她一直铭记在心的是：太贪心，幸福永远在遥远的天边，摸不著也看不见；不贪心，幸福就在眼前、在心里；而她，一点也不贪心，所以她对她男朋友一切的不体贴、不温柔、不陪著她……甚至没事就会糗她、欺负她，用毒舌来“凌迟”她，简直就跟一般的男朋友完全不同，不！是压根没得比！她完全不在意，因她是真心的知道──他对她……一直都有把她放在他的心底，而这样，对她而言就已足够……", "base": "files/article/html/34/34806", "chapters": [{"title": "序幕", "file": "2257399.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第1页", "file": "2257400.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2页", "file": "2257401.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3页", "file": "2257402.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4页", "file": "2257403.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5页", "file": "2257404.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6页", "file": "2257405.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7页", "file": "2257406.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8页", "file": "2257407.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9页", "file": "2257408.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10页", "file": "2257409.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11页", "file": "2257410.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12页", "file": "2257411.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13页", "file": "2257412.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14页", "file": "2257413.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15页", "file": "2257414.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16页", "file": "2257415.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17页", "file": "2257416.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18页", "file": "2257417.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19页", "file": "2257418.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20页", "file": "2257419.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21页", "file": "2257420.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22页", "file": "2257421.html", "